<title>USA: BA Securities Anaheim, Calif., $95 mln electric.</title>
<headline>BA Securities Anaheim, Calif., $95 mln electric.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BA Securities said it won $95 million of Anaheim, Calif., electric revenue bonds, issue of 1996, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 4.67 percent.</p>
